OL,4,B'He will see what Man Utd are made of' 
OL,5,B- Pulis on Pochettino's first game     
OL,6,GStepping into a job like Mauricio      
OL,7,GPochettino has done at Manchester      
OL,8,GUnited, where managers have come and   
OL,9,Ggone frequently, will always lead you  
OL,10,Gto wonder why the others have not      
OL,11,Glasted very long.                      
OL,13,FIrrespective of results, you face      
OL,14,Fthese first few days in your new post  
OL,15,Fwith suspicion.                        
OL,17,FSo, while what happens in Pochettino's 
OL,18,Ffirst game against Liverpool on Sunday 
OL,19,Fis important, it will not define his   
OL,20,Fearly opinions of the club - good or   
OL,21,Fbad.                                   
